  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As magnetic moment of both the coil is the same,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math></p>",
